da2752689f6f7c0a16298825e39789e08d8d5eda126e41470e991c4c4d0","download_count":4,"created_at":"2026-09-11T18:56:08Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T18:56:08Z"},{"id":557820627,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSIatD84hP6rT","name":"Reasonix-windows-arm64-installer.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":212927416,"digest":"sha256:cdcfd12ed110580c3acac831ac88bbb4f7dda0ebc1133ad47a416b50fe6f63b4","download_count":3,"created_at":"2026-09-11T18:56:24Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T18:56:30Z"},{"id":557820866,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSIatD84hP6vC","name":"Reasonix-windows-arm64-installer.exe.minisig","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":293,"digest":"sha256:bf7462d5b77f5e4698dbd9e8a72e5eda7c0b0c6ee647f8469f4b9fd19fbc1785","download_count":4,"created_at":"2026-09-11T18:56:33Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T18:56:34Z"},{"id":557819832,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSIatD84hP6e4","name":"Reasonix-windows-arm64.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":233104570,"digest":"sha256:e14ab720042c952127980d121c12004d3526596ecec6b3a5322bf67bf121144b","download_count":3,"created_at":"2026-09-11T18:55:54Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T18:56:01Z"},{"id":557821355,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSIatD84hP62r","name":"Reasonix-windows-arm64.zip.minisig","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":283,"digest":"sha256:37edd3d4ec7f064c196d2aa442dd7fbfc748cc380a49fa03dd88a27e7d3e0e73","download_count":4,"created_at":"2026-09-11T18:56:53Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T18:56:54Z"}],"body":"> 桌面端可靠性与易用性改进，包括 Windows 启动修复、浏览器控制以及聊天记录布局修正。\n\n**发布渠道：稳定版 · v1.38.7**\n\n[English →](https://reasonix.io/changelog/v1.38.7/?lang=en) · [网页版完整更新日志 →](https://reasonix.io/changelog/v1.38.7/)\n\n## 使用攻略\n\n- [**Windows 应用身份**](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/blob/0c35021eb330f38cadde7831a8bb561d5988a970/docs/WINDOWS_APP_IDENTITY.md) — Reasonix 桌面端如何隔离其 Windows 任务栏身份与 Studio，并管理快捷方式。\n- [**Windows 启动恢复**](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/blob/0c35021eb330f38cadde7831a8bb561d5988a970/docs/WINDOWS_STARTUP_RECOVERY.md) — Windows 上从失效桌面壳恢复的设计与验收标准。\n- [**桌面浏览器**](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/blob/0c35021eb330f38cadde7831a8bb561d5988a970/docs/DESKTOP_BROWSER.md) — 内置浏览器控制设置与 Chrome 登录状态导入。\n- [**聊天记录投影**](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/blob/0c35021eb330f38cadde7831a8bb561d5988a970/docs/TRANSCRIPT_PROJECTION.md) — 聊天记录的历史快照与实时事件统一投影。\n- [**检查点**](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/blob/0c35021eb330f38cadde7831a8bb561d5988a970/docs/CHECKPOINTS.md) — 可配置的回溯快照保留策略。\n\n## 概览\n\n**Reasonix v1.38.7 — Reasonix 1.38.7**\n\n桌面端可靠性与易用性改进，包括 Windows 启动修复、浏览器控制以及聊天记录布局修正。\n\n发布日期：2026-09-11\n\n**Desktop 17 · CLI 3**\n\n## 桌面端更新\n\n### 重点内容\n\n- **[Desktop]** **内置浏览器控制设置** — 设置中心新增“浏览器控制”页面，可启用内置浏览器、导入 Chrome 登录状态、管理证书验证并清除浏览器数据。 ([#10080](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10080))\n- **[Desktop]** **Windows 启动与窗口可靠性** — 修复失效壳恢复、任务栏身份隔离、启动黑框闪现以及窗口几何信息持久化问题。 ([#10115](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10115), [#10130](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10130), [#10111](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10111), [#10128](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10128))\n- **[Desktop]** **聊天记录布局与命令可见性** — 长内容不再溢出聊天面板，展开的终端工具卡显示完整命令。 ([#10137](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10137), [#6298](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/6298), [#9860](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/9860))\n\n### 新增\n\n- **[Desktop]** **内置浏览器控制设置** — 设置中心新增“浏览器控制”页面，可启用内置浏览器、导入 Chrome 登录状态、忽略访客会话证书错误，以及清除浏览器缓存或全部数据。 ([#10080](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10080))\n- **[Desktop · CLI]** **可配置的检查点保留策略** — 新增 [checkpoints] 配置项 retain_turns 与 blob_quota_bytes，用于控制回溯快照保留。 ([#9911](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/9911))\n\n### 改进\n\n- **[Desktop]** **聊天记录投影统一** — 统一历史快照与实时事件投影，避免内容重复与事件遗漏，并提升检查点性能。 ([#9983](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/9983))\n- **[Desktop]** **会话切换校验** — 会话切换快照现会与控制器捕获的历史进行校验，并报告加载阶段。 ([#10120](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10120))\n- **[Desktop]** **限时性能采样** — 性能诊断现采用限时采样与按需分析，无需持续 CPU 采样即可识别卡顿与内存增长。 ([#10124](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10124))\n- **[Desktop]** **能力阶段指标修复** — 修复 capability_phases 耗时桶恒为零的问题，补齐阶段发出与计费。 ([#9981](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/9981))\n\n### 修复\n\n- **[Desktop]** **Windows 壳生命周期恢复** — 修复服务握手失败后失效壳进程占用单实例锁的问题，引入显式恢复状态模型。 ([#10115](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10115))\n- **[Desktop]** **Windows 任务栏身份隔离** — 桌面端现使用 io.reasonix.desktop 作为壳、启动器、服务、快捷方式与通知的身份，避免与 Studio 归组。 ([#10130](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10130))\n- **[Desktop]** **Windows 启动黑框闪现** — 修复从快捷方式启动 Windows 桌面时短暂出现控制台窗口的问题。 ([#10111](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10111))\n- **[Desktop]** **窗口几何信息持久化** — 持久化还原矩形而非最大化边框，避免还原时出现超大窗口。 ([#10128](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10128))\n- **[Desktop]** **聊天记录溢出与命令可见性** — 长内容不再使聊天记录超出聊天面板，展开的终端工具卡显示完整命令。 ([#10137](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10137), [#6298](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/6298), [#9860](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/9860))\n- **[Desktop]** **压缩回执可见性** — /compact 回执现渲染在进程折叠之外，用户可看到压缩结果。 ([#10132](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10132))\n- **[Desktop · CLI]** **模型覆盖 max_output_tokens 保留** — 修复单独使用逐模型 max_output_tokens 时被静默丢弃的问题。 ([#10094](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10094))\n- **[Desktop]** **DeepSeek Flash 思考深度** — 修复 deepseek-flash 别名缺少思考深度控制的问题。 ([#10117](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10117))\n\n## CLI 端更新\n\n### 新增\n\n- **[Desktop · CLI]** **可配置的检查点保留策略** — 新增 [checkpoints] 配置项 retain_turns 与 blob_quota_bytes，用于控制回溯快照保留。 ([#9911](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/9911))\n\n### 修复\n\n- **[CLI]** **WSL 剪贴板 UTF-8 保留** — 修复从 WSL 复制中文等 UTF-8 内容出现乱码的问题，改用 PowerShell UTF-8 桥接而非原始 clip.exe。 ([#10074](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10074))\n- **[Desktop · CLI]** **模型覆盖 max_output_tokens 保留** — 修复单独使用逐模型 max_output_tokens 时被静默丢弃的问题。 ([#10094](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/10094))\n\n## 升级提醒\n\n本版本无需手动迁移。\n\n## 风险提示\n\n当前没有需要额外操作的已知风险。\n\n## 致谢\n\n感谢本版本的贡献者：[@SivanCola](https://github.com/SivanCola)、[@boscocp](https://github.com/boscocp)、[@SauronSkywalker](https://github.com/SauronSkywalker)、[@Linearl](https://github.com/Linearl)、[@lengxiaouser](https://github.com/lengxiaouser)\n\n## 下载与安装\n\n- [官网按平台下载](https://reasonix.io/?download=desktop&channel=stable#start)\n- [查看完整差异](https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/compare/desktop-v1.38.6...desktop-v1.38.7)\n"}
